  "story": {
    "title": "Flower blind",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Chat was born blind. Her eyes had never seen her parents, or her brothers and sisters. She knew their faces by touch.",
      "One day, Chat was strolling in the garden. She liked the sweet scent of flowers. She loved to touch their soft petals.",
      "Chat wished she could see flowers, just once. \"They are lovely,\" she said to herself.",
      "Every day, Chat walked in the garden. She knew her way around. Today, she raised her head to the skies.",
      "Suddenly, she heard thunder and lightning. \"I need to hurry back to the house,\" Chat thought.",
      "Rain began to fall. Chat slipped, lost her balance and fell. She hit her head on a stone.",
      "When Chat woke up, there were people around her. \"What happened?\" she asked.",
      "\"You fell and bumped your head,\" her father said. \"Thank God you are fine,\" said her mother.",
      "\"Daddy, mummy?\" asked Chat. She also called the names of her brothers and sisters. \"Please, get me a flower.\" Everyone was surprised.",
      "Her sister returned with a flower. Chat held it gently. \"It is so lovely,\" she said.",
      "Her family looked at one another. \"Chat, can you see the flower?\" her mother asked.",
      "Chat played with the flower in her hand. \"You are all so beautiful, just like this flower,\" she smiled."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Chat was born blind.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chat sinh ra đã bị mù."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Her eyes had never seen her parents, or her brothers and sisters.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mắt của cô bé chưa bao giờ nhìn thấy bố mẹ, hay anh chị em của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She knew their faces by touch.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé biết mặt họ qua cách chạm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day, Chat was strolling in the garden.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, Chat đang đi dạo trong vườn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She liked the sweet scent of flowers.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé thích mùi hương ngọt ngào của hoa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She loved to touch their soft petals.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé thích chạm vào những cánh hoa mềm mại của chúng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chat wished she could see flowers, just once.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chat ước mình có thể nhìn thấy hoa, dù chỉ một lần thôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"They are lovely,\" she said to herself.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Chúng thật đáng yêu,\" cô bé tự nhủ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Every day, Chat walked in the garden.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mỗi ngày, Chat đều đi bộ trong vườn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She knew her way around.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé biết đường đi lối lại."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Today, she raised her head to the skies.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hôm nay, cô bé ngẩng đầu nhìn lên bầu trời."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Suddenly, she heard thunder and lightning.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bỗng nhiên, cô bé nghe thấy tiếng sấm và chớp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I need to hurry back to the house,\" Chat thought.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Mình cần nhanh chóng về nhà,\" Chat nghĩ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Rain began to fall.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mưa bắt đầu rơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chat slipped, lost her balance and fell.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chat trượt chân, mất thăng bằng và ngã."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She hit her head on a stone.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé đập đầu vào một hòn đá."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When Chat woke up, there were people around her.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi Chat tỉnh dậy, có nhiều người xung quanh cô bé."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"What happened?\" she asked.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Chuyện gì đã xảy ra vậy ạ?\" cô bé hỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"You fell and bumped your head,\" her father said.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Con bị ngã và đập đầu,\" bố cô bé nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Thank God you are fine,\" said her mother.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Ơn trời con không sao,\" mẹ cô bé nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Daddy, mummy?\" asked Chat.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Bố ơi, mẹ ơi?\" Chat hỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She also called the names of her brothers and sisters.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé còn gọi tên các anh chị em của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Please, get me a flower.\" Everyone was surprised.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Làm ơn, lấy cho con một bông hoa.\" Mọi người đều ngạc nhiên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Her sister returned with a flower.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chị gái cô bé quay lại với một bông hoa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chat held it gently.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chat cầm nó một cách nhẹ nhàng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"It is so lovely,\" she said.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Nó thật đáng yêu,\" cô bé nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Her family looked at one another.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Gia đình cô bé nhìn nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Chat, can you see the flower?\" her mother asked.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Chat, con có nhìn thấy bông hoa không?\" mẹ cô bé hỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Chat played with the flower in her hand.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_028.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chat chơi đùa với bông hoa trong tay."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"You are all so beautiful, just like this flower,\" she smiled.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_173263/s_029.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Mọi người đều thật xinh đẹp, giống như bông hoa này vậy,\" cô bé mỉm cười."
      }
    ]
  },
